  "description": "Download Ball Sort Puzzle - A fun and engaging color sorting game that's free and simple to install. Safe from viruses and malware, ensuring you always have the latest version.",
  "editor_review": "Prepare yourself for a soothing and addictive color sorting experience! This ball sorting puzzle is crafted not only for fun but also for mental enhancement. Organize the colored balls to fill each container with identical hues, while enjoying the calming and diverting benefits of the game. With thousands of puzzles available, ranging in difficulty, your logical reasoning will be put to the test, keeping you thoroughly entertained. Enjoy effortless one-finger controls, countless levels, and no time limits. Stimulate your mind with this straightforward yet captivating gameplay. Ideal for players of all ages, this offline game is a fantastic choice for family fun. Download today and master the art of Color Sorting!",
  "how_to_play": [
    "Tap to select a ball and stack it in another container that shares the same color",
    "Finish the puzzles by sorting all balls into a single container",
    "Utilize 'Undo' to revert to earlier moves",
    "Add an additional container if you find yourself stuck",
    "Restart the level at any time"
  ],
